1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,382
Talent is everywhere.

2
00:00:01,872 --> 00:00:03,450
Opportunity is not.

3
00:00:04,182 --> 00:00:09,035
At Mill Creek-AR Learning Center in Accra,
twelve students fill every available place.

4
00:00:09,495 --> 00:00:16,363
With fifteen computers, three instructors,
and two community advocates, students receive
eight hours of instruction each week.

5
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:21,616
Students move from keyboarding and digital basics
to Python and problem-solving.

6
00:00:22,306 --> 00:00:31,685
The next step is expanding the class schedule for Ghana's
junior and senior high school students—roughly middle-
and high-school-age students in U.S. terms.

7
00:00:32,625 --> 00:00:43,720
Our twenty-five-thousand-dollar goal supports computers,
broadband internet, learning materials, technology instruction,
facility costs, and improvements.

8
00:00:44,530 --> 00:00:48,308
Give any amount today through Zeffy
or sponsor a student journey.

9
00:00:48,858 --> 00:00:51,186
Help turn access into opportunity.

